l all-stream minimizer existence.","overflowX":"visible","class":"","left":47.59375,"right":342.40625,"scrollWidth":295,"clientWidth":295},{"tag":"DD","text":"Use the same canonical ordered divergence B_psi(a;b)=psi(a)-psi(b)-Dpsi(b)[a-b], with target first and derivative base second. The","overflowX":"visible","class":"","left":47.59375,"right":342.40625,"scrollWidth":295,"clientWidth":295},{"tag":"DD","text":"State0=x0; loss t/eta t consumed for state(t+1). Positive current eta only for performance; arbitrary eta for generic specs.","overflowX":"visible","class":"","left":47.59375,"right":342.40625,"scrollWidth":295,"clientWidth":295},{"tag":"DD","text":"Same-produced-transition finite-part loss difference with both signed residuals, plus two finite concrete run instances. Full cumu","overflowX":"visible","class":"","left":47.59375,"right":342.40625,"scrollWidth":295,"clientWidth":295},{"tag":"DD","text":"The whole current loss is received before the played prediction. Lean state0 is source x0; Lean loss t is source round t+1 and pla","overflowX":"visible","class":"","left":47.59375,"right":342.40625,"scrollWidth":295,"clientWidth":295},{"tag":"DIV","text":"Source mathematical statement. Formula renderer unavailable; readable fallback: For the signed one-step result, both consecutive s","overflowX":"auto","class":"math-statement math-rendered is-scrollable","left":33,"right":357,"scrollWidth":528,"clientWidth":320},{"tag":"P","text":"BanditRLlib relationship. Orabona, Online Learning, arXiv:1912.13213v10 (2026-06-21): Chapter 2 prescient observation, printed 14 ","overflowX":"visible","class":"source-note","left":33,"right":357,"scrollWidth":554,"clientWidth":320},{"tag":"P","text":"The mathematical content is restated in this site's notation; wording is ours. See printed 14,16-17,63-64,265-266 / PDF 26,28-29,7","overflowX":"visible","class":"copyright-note","left":33,"right":357,"scrollWidth":324,"clientWidth":324}]},{"title":"Chapter 2 prescient dependency: same